Dear Confirmation Candidates and Parents,

Our confirmation retreat will be held on Saturday, March 7, 2026, at Camp Wendover. The day includes small groups, a service project, lunch and an evening Mass with families.

Candidates should wear comfortable clothes and bring a water bottle and a sleeping bag for the afternoon rest period. Phones are collected at arrival and returned at departure.

The cost of $45 covers meals, transportation and materials. Scholarships are available; ask Nadia Pemberton.

Bus details will follow by email.

In Christ,
Nadia Pemberton, Director of Religious Education
